      <title>费马大定理Lean形式化：社区多年积累与Claude的辅助角色</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260904/%E8%B4%B9%E9%A9%AC%E5%A4%A7%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86Lean%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%8C%96%E7%A4%BE%E5%8C%BA%E5%A4%9A%E5%B9%B4%E7%A7%AF%E7%B4%AF%E4%B8%8EClaude%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2/</link>
